---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Zeta"
  description="Learn about Zeta's mission, leadership philosophy, professional standards, and commitment to developing future leaders."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">About Zeta</p>

      <h1>A Leadership Community Built for Growth</h1>

      <p>
        Zeta is a professional financial services branch and leadership
        community committed to developing capable professionals,
        strengthening leadership, and creating opportunities for people to
        grow through mentorship, financial education, and meaningful
        service. Guided by Branch Head Shane Villasor Perez, Zeta is
        building a culture where today's professionals become tomorrow's
        leaders—and future builders of leaders.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Identity -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell split-layout">

      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Who We Are"
        title="More Than a Personal Brand"
        text="While Shane Villasor Perez serves as Zeta's public-facing leader, the organization is built on a broader mission: developing professionals, cultivating leadership, and creating a community where people grow together through shared values and purpose."
      />

      <div class="principles-panel">

        <article>
          <span>01</span>

          <h3>Professional Excellence</h3>

          <p>
            We promote high standards of professionalism through ethical
            conduct, continuous learning, responsible client service, and a
            commitment to delivering value with integrity.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>

          <h3>Mentorship & Development</h3>

          <p>
            Growth is supported through structured learning, practical
            experience, coaching, and mentorship that help individuals
            develop confidence, capability, and leadership potential.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>

          <h3>Leadership That Multiplies</h3>

          <p>
            We believe leadership is most meaningful when it empowers others
            to succeed. By developing leaders who mentor future leaders,
            Zeta aims to build a sustainable organization that creates
            opportunities for generations to come.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Vision -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Our Vision"
        title="Building a Community of Future Leaders"
        text="Our long-term vision extends beyond professional success. We aspire to create an environment where individuals continue learning, serve with purpose, lead with integrity, and help others discover opportunities for growth."
      />

      <blockquote>
        “Leadership becomes more meaningful when it creates more leaders.”
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        This belief shapes the way Zeta approaches mentorship, leadership
        development, financial education, and organizational growth. Every
        initiative is designed to encourage continuous improvement,
        collaboration, and responsible leadership that benefits both
        individuals and the communities they serve.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
